<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia confirms Feb CPI rises 1.05 percent.</title>
<headline>Indonesia confirms Feb CPI rises 1.05 percent.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's consumer price index (CPI) rose 1.05 percent month-on-month in February against a rise of 1.03 percent in January, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			   Feb	 Jan	Feb 96</p>
<p>    Month/month    +1.05     +1.03	 + 1.71</p>
<p>    Year/year	+4.68     +5.34	 +10.04</p>
<p>CPI sectors (month/month)</p>
<p>    Food	     +2.49     +1.85</p>
<p>    Housing	  -0.01     +0.25</p>
<p>    Textiles	 +1.20     +0.58</p>
<p>    Services	 +0.47     +0.92</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
